<emph>
P0515: Battery Temperature Sensor Circuit
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Any of the following conditions is met.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Output voltage of battery temperature sensor signal circuit is lower than 0.10 V for 5 sec.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
